1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,246
As Uke comes to strike the side of your head

2
00:00:02,247 --> 00:00:03,446
raise both arms

3
00:00:03,447 --> 00:00:06,975
stepping deeply controlling the strike
around in a big circular movement.

4
00:00:06,976 --> 00:00:09,197
Continue this movement in the same direction

5
00:00:09,198 --> 00:00:11,356
by sliding forward controlling his wrist,

6
00:00:11,657 --> 00:00:13,162
turn sharply and cut down

7
00:00:13,863 --> 00:00:15,587
Controlling his wrist and elbow

8
00:00:15,588 --> 00:00:17,295
turn Uke´s body over

9
00:00:17,296 --> 00:00:19,725
placing his shoulder in between your knees.

10
00:00:20,926 --> 00:00:21,972
As you sit down

11
00:00:22,373 --> 00:00:24,615
control his wrist with your opposite arm,

12
00:00:24,916 --> 00:00:27,007
hugging that arm close against the body

13
00:00:27,008 --> 00:00:30,074
turn your body towards his head for the pin.

